अभ्युत्थानमधर्मस्य तदात्मानं सृजाम्यहम् ॥ ७ ॥\"}]},{\"section\":\"verse_text\",\"section_title\":\"Books.Verse.verse-text\",\"children\":[{\"type\":\"content.Record\",\"title\":\"verse_text\",\"id\":1314,\"bb\":1170,\"url_path\":\"/en/library/bg/4/7/b1170/\",\"body_value\":\"yadā yadā hi dharmasya
glānir bhavati bhārata
abhyutthānam adharmasya
tadātmānaṁ sṛjāmy aham\"}]},{\"section\":\"synonyms\",\"section_title\":\"Books.Verse.synonyms\",\"children\":[{\"type\":\"books.Synonyms\",\"title\":\"synonyms\",\"id\":1315,\"bb\":1171,\"url_path\":\"/en/library/bg/4/7/b1171/\",\"shadow_value\":\"yadā yadā – whenever and wherever; hi – certainly; dharmasya – of religion; glāniḥ – discrepancies; bhavati – become manifested; bhārata – O descendant of Bharata; abhyutthānam – predominance; adharmasya – of irreligion; tadā – at that time; ātmānam – self; sṛjāmi – manifest; aham – I.\",\"word_for_word_value\":[{\"word\":\"yadā yadā\",\"translation\":\"whenever and wherever\"},{\"word\":\"hi\",\"translation\":\"certainly\"},{\"word\":\"dharmasya\",\"translation\":\"of religion\"},{\"word\":\"glāniḥ\",\"translation\":\"discrepancies\"},{\"word\":\"bhavati\",\"translation\":\"become manifested\"},{\"word\":\"bhārata\",\"translation\":\"O descendant of Bharata\"},{\"word\":\"abhyutthānam\",\"translation\":\"predominance\"},{\"word\":\"adharmasya\",\"translation\":\"of irreligion\"},{\"word\":\"tadā\",\"translation\":\"at that time\"},{\"word\":\"ātmānam\",\"translation\":\"self\"},{\"word\":\"sṛjāmi\",\"translation\":\"manifest\"},{\"word\":\"aham\",\"translation\":\"I\"}]}]},{\"section\":\"translation\",\"section_title\":\"Books.Verse.translation\",\"children\":[{\"type\":\"content.Record\",\"title\":\"translation\",\"id\":1316,\"bb\":1172,\"url_path\":\"/en/library/bg/4/7/b1172/\",\"body_value\":\"Whenever and wherever there is a decline in religious practice, O descendant of Bharata, and a predominant rise of irreligion – at that time I descend Myself.\"}]},{\"section\":\"purport\",\"section_title\":\"Books.Verse.purport\",\"children\":[{\"type\":\"content.Record\",\"title\":\"paragraph\",\"id\":1317,\"bb\":1173,\"url_path\":\"/en/library/bg/4/7/b1173/\",\"body_value\":\"$25\"},{\"type\":\"content.Record\",\"title\":\"paragraph\",\"id\":1318,\"bb\":1174,\"url_path\":\"/en/library/bg/4/7/b1174/\",\"body_value\":\"The principles of the Bhagavad-gītā were spoken to Arjuna, and, for that matter, to other highly elevated persons, because he was highly advanced compared to ordinary persons in other parts of the world. Two plus two equals four is a mathematical principle that is true in the beginner’s arithmetic class and in the advanced class as well. Still, there are higher and lower mathematics. In all incarnations of the Lord, therefore, the same principles are taught, but they appear to be higher and lower in varied circumstances. The higher principles of religion begin with the acceptance of the four orders and the four statuses of social life, as will be explained later. The whole purpose of the mission of incarnations is to arouse Kṛṣṇa consciousness everywhere. Such consciousness is manifest and nonmanifest only under different circumstances.\"}]}],\"short_title\":\"Bg. 4.7\",\"medium_title\":\"Bhagavad-gītā As It Is 4.7\"},\"locale\":\"en\",\"activeView\":\"$6:props:activeView\"}]}],\"$L26\",\"$L27\",\"$L28\"]}]\n"])self.__next_f.push([1,"2a:I[83068,[\"/_next/static/chunks/130enlymdm.jk.js\",\"/_next/static/chunks/0b6f_zxj9ay~6.js\",\"/_next/static/chunks/143cg6c13uly6.js\",\"/_next/static/chunks/07vk.k35-e~ti.js\",\"/_next/static/chunks/0j6k6n9cniknh.js\",\"/_next/static/chunks/0.zxv9arc6a56.js\",\"/_next/static/chunks/00-zmo-3n1bt8.js\",\"/_next/static/chunks/0p4z5tusn0jt6.js\",\"/_next/static/chunks/01mcazkjru_is.js\"],\"default\"]\n30:I[78455,[\"/_next/static/chunks/130enlymdm.jk.js\",\"/_next/static/chunks/0b6f_zxj9ay~6.js\",\"/_next/static/chunks/143cg6c13uly6.js\",\"/_next/static/chunks/07vk.k35-e~ti.js\",\"/_next/static/chunks/0j6k6n9cniknh.js\",\"/_next/static/chunks/0.zxv9arc6a56.js\",\"/_next/static/chunks/00-zmo-3n1bt8.js\",\"/_next/static/chunks/0p4z5tusn0jt6.js\",\"/_next/static/chunks/01mcazkjru_is.js\"],\"default\"]\n26:[\"$\",\"div\",null,{\"className\":\"px-4 py-4 w-full max-w-screen-xl mx-auto md:px-8 mb-3\",\"children\":[[\"$\",\"nav\",null,{\"aria-label\":\"